      "title": "File:Location of the Acharnean Gate in Kotzia Square on November 11, 2019.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a0/Location_of_the_Acharnean_Gate_in_Kotzia_Square_on_November_11%2C_2019.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Location_of_the_Acharnean_Gate_in_Kotzia_Square_on_November_11,_2019.jpg",
